MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Native browser view hides when rail collapsed / other tab / unmounted
  (visible requires boundsReady && railVisible && no dialog) — fixes float-over-chat
- Recorder: pinned always-visible Record button + custom audio player
  (play/pause, seek, mono timestamps, 1x-2x speed)
- Study review: Anki-style New/Learning/Review counts replace progress bar
- Graph: label-size slider (4-24) + larger default/min node size
- Settings: Pets hidden for students; Connections presets + Quizlet/Notion/
  Google Drive/OneNote/Teams
- Ledger removed from sidebar nav (route + Today trust-card link remain)
